          {
            "title": "Comparing",
            "id": 76931,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We learned how to create and store values, but how do we compare them?</p><p>Like checking if a user's entered PIN matches their saved PIN.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"entered_pin = \" /><text value=\"5448\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"expected_pin = \" /><text value=\"5440\" class=\"number\" /></content></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Equality operator",
            "id": 76930,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To compare if two numbers are the same, we use the <strong>equality operator</strong>, <code>==</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"python\"><content><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"2\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"4\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>=</code>, followed by <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To compare if two numbers are the same, we use the <strong>equality operator</strong>, <code>==</code>.</p><p>Complete a comparison between two equal numbers.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"2\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>==</code>, followed by <code>5</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "True or false",
            "id": 76929,
