            ],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><img src=\"151b6e63-caf5-4fe2-abd9-b39b49d9a8da\" visible-if=\"always\" /><p>When comparing, there are only two results: <code>True</code> or <code>False</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Equality operator",
            "id": 76928,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>When we compare the same numbers with the equality operator, the result is <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"14\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>10</code>, followed by <code>==</code>, and finally <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>When we compare the same numbers with the equality operator, the result is <code>True</code>.</p><p>Compare whether <code>10</code> is equal to <code>10</code> so the code prints <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"11\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>10</code>, followed by <code>==</code>, and finally <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Equality operator",
            "id": 76927,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>When we compare the different numbers with the equality operator, the result is <code>False</code>. Like here with the <code>9</code> to <code>10</code> comparison.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"9 = 10\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>9 == 10</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>When we compare different numbers with the equality operator, the result is <code>False</code>.</p><p>Pick the comparison of <code>9</code> and <code>10</code> that prints <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"9 = 10\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10 == 10\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"9 == 9\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>9 == 10</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 76901,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What do we use to check if two numbers are equal? </p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>==</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We use the equality operator to check if two numbers are equal.</p><p>You need a Boolean that is <code>True</code> only when <code>score</code> and <code>target</code> are the same number. Which operator belongs between them?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>==</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>=</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>!=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
